<title>USA: U.S. farm wheel tractor sales up 3.5 pct in August.</title>
<headline>U.S. farm wheel tractor sales up 3.5 pct in August.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. sales of farm wheel tractors rose 3.5 percent in August to 8,401 units from 8,113 in the same month of 1995, the Equipment Manufacturers Institute reported Wednesday.</p>
<p>In the year to date, sales of farm wheel tractors rose 6.5 percent to 78,600 units from 73,779 in the 1995 period, the trade association said.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
